# Slicer scratch (3mf, cache, resolved profiles) — regenerated locally
slicer/build/
__pycache__/

# Note: src/lib/data/*.generated.json are generated by slicer/filament.py and
# ARE committed — they're the site's input. NOTHING binary is committed: STL
# masters, plates, renders, thumbnails, and the all-parts zip all live on the
# content-addressed bucket, pinned by hash/URL (scripts/sync_bucket.py).

# stray OrcaSlicer logs
slicer/*.log

# raw STL drop zone (upload with scripts/sync_bucket.py --upload, pin the hash)
slicer/inbox/

# Product images never enter git. Upload them and reference the URL:
#   python scripts/sync_bucket.py --upload <file>   -> paste the image_url
# This used to be an LFS directory; pointer stubs got published as the images
# and broke every hardware photo on the site. See CLAUDE.md.
slicer/images/
